      "block_type": 0
    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p22_b5",
      "text": "keeps the worst-case reward perturbation concentrated on the threatening response, and\ngives the budget the direct meaning of total promptwise reward misspecification mass.\nOnce the response space is only partially observed through grouped rollouts, this sparse\nand local structure is exactly what makes the DRRO correction estimable.\n",
