    },
    {
      "block_id": "2605.00155_p22_b8",
      "text": "to isolate the decision-theoretic question studied in the paper: when a policy is optimized\nagainst an imperfect proxy reward, does regret robustness preserve useful improvement\nbetter than value robustness and other mitigation strategies?\n",
